rows.abstract:
Seeks to address the critical issues concerning our country's security and stability;
Intends to bolster the national defense apparatus, enhance the capabilities of our armed forces, and  ensure a swift and decisive response to insurgency and other threats to our national security.
 
Proposes a Comprehensive National Defense Act that would set up the framework and mechanisms in coordination with several agencies (DILG, DND, AFP) in dealing with the complex issues and multi-dimensional aspect of national security and defense.
